# Cascading Cataracts: "Indestructible" (CR 702.12). Bot2 sacrifices its Strip Mine to destroy the Cataracts and it stays
# on the battlefield; the Strip Mine goes to the graveyard all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Cascading Cataracts
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Strip Mine
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Cascading Cataracts.Play
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Strip Mine.Play
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Strip Mine.Activate(Ability: Destroy target land; Bot1.Battlefield.Cascading Cataracts)
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Cascading Cataracts
Bot2.Graveyard = Strip Mine
Stack.Count = 0
